    </div>

    <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="address" data-hint="Two requires a plural noun. Address ends in an s sound." data-fix="The customer gave me two addresses." data-why="A regular noun ending in -s adds -es, so address becomes addresses.">
      <h3>Repair from memory</h3>
      <p>Tap the word that is wrong.</p>
